{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1512.unity3d","item_key":"commands[9].text","source_sha256":"5cb003fbd8d01bdd446c38b5f6f46f9a9887559dec2f0668e6e5e5f3a01dc074","ja":"真面目にお掃除してほしかったのですが……。\n捜しに行くのです。","zh":"本想让大家好好打扫的……\n去找找看吧。","status":"accepted","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T15:34:04+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1512.unity3d","item_key":"commands[10].text","source_sha256":"8ea8a26f7980547d91be9c4926707de34b6d6904ce652be93f7f5ea74dd2373b","ja":"見つけるの、大変じゃないかしら。\n真美ちゃんって、結構本格的に隠れちゃいそうだし。","zh":"要找到她会不会很费劲呀？\n毕竟真美感觉会藏得相当认真呢。","status":"accepted","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T15:34:04+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1512.unity3d","item_key":"commands[11].text","source_sha256":"3f500dd785ca558fbb7249bc60c569f80350f8a5f39bf3f2469649fc6e5b37bf","ja":"それなら、真美ちゃんの方から、\n戻って来てもらうようにするのですよ。","zh":"既然这样，那就想办法让真美\n主动回来吧。","status":"accepted","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T15:34:04+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1512.unity3d","item_key":"commands[12].text","source_sha256":"52aaa35c58f451b3bfa9b68c61e20744edd6d08247230adba9e0209635ebbc26","ja":"そうね……あ、ちょうどいい物があったわ。\nこれを使ってみましょ♪","zh":"是呢……啊，正好有合适的东西。\n试着用这个看看吧♪","status":"accepted","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T15:34:04+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1512.unity3d","item_key":"commands[19].text","source_sha256":"9b9ee3387931cbb755de9c441ddfbb7236b32d695be3ec10db8b36ce385c679e","ja":"（……あれ？　りおっちもまつり姫も来ない……）","zh":"（……咦？莉绪姐和茉莉姬都没来……）","status":"accepted","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T15:34:04+00:00"}
